## Cultural Heritage Notice

This project involves the preservation and computational processing of Kikuyu 
cultural knowledge, including traditional proverbs and linguistic structures.

**Cultural Respect Statement:**
- All cultural content is used with deep respect for Kikuyu traditions
- Traditional knowledge is handled according to community protocols
- Cultural consultants and knowledge holders are appropriately acknowledged
- This work aims to preserve and honor Kikuyu cultural heritage

**Academic Use:**
This software is developed as part of academic research at the Open Institute 
of Technology (OPIT) under the supervision of Dr. Marzieh Bakhshandeh.

**Community Acknowledgment:**
The author acknowledges the Kikuyu community as the source and rightful owner
of the cultural knowledge represented in this system. This work is intended
to support cultural preservation and cross-cultural understanding.
